OL,3,CUnborn child survived fall which
OL,4,Ckilled pregnant woman, inquest hears
OL,6,FA pregnant woman fell to her death
OL,7,Ffrom a tower block while her unborn
OL,8,Fchild survived the impact, an inquest
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FEmma Atkinson fell from Shakespeare
OL,12,FTowers in Burmantofts, Leeds, in
OL,13,FOctober 2024, with her daughter safely
OL,14,Fdelivered within half an hour of the
OL,15,Ffall.
OL,17,FThe 38-year-old had been more than
OL,18,Fseven months pregnant at the time, and
OL,19,Fhad been visiting her father in a flat
OL,20,Fin the tower block.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/8
