FL,340,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786385905
OL,3,CUnborn child survived fall which
OL,4,Ckilled pregnant woman, inquest hears
OL,6,FA hearing into her death on Thursday
OL,7,Fheard Ms Atkinson "deliberately
OL,8,Fpropelled" herself from the living
OL,9,Froom window, though there was no
OL,10,Findication she had meant to end her
OL,11,Flife.
OL,13,FThe mother of five had been sitting on
OL,14,Fthe back of a chair and smoking out of
OL,15,Fthe living room window when she
OL,16,Fremoved the safety catches and opened
OL,17,Fit horizontally, a statement read out
OL,18,Fat Wakefield Coroner's Court heard on
OL,19,FThursday.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,340,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786385905
OL,3,CUnborn child survived fall which
OL,4,Ckilled pregnant woman, inquest hears
OL,6,FMr Atkinson, in his statement, said he
OL,7,Fhad asked his daughter what she was
OL,8,Fdoing and told her to shut the window,
OL,9,Fbut she replied saying "not to worry"
OL,10,Fand that she was "just getting some
OL,11,Ffresh air".
OL,13,FShortly after, Ms Atkinson said, "I'm
OL,14,Foff", before her father described
OL,15,Fseeing her feet go out of the window.
OL,17,FHe ran to the window and saw his
OL,18,Fdaughter on the pavement below, the
OL,19,Finquest heard.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,340,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786385905
OL,3,CUnborn child survived fall which
OL,4,Ckilled pregnant woman, inquest hears
OL,6,FParamedics called to the scene
OL,7,Fpronounced Ms Atkinson dead, but
OL,8,Fbrought her to Leeds General Infirmary
OL,9,Fwhere her daughter was delivered by
OL,10,FCaesarean section.
OL,12,FDetective Constable Emily Parnham told
OL,13,Fthe court Ms Atkinson's fall was
OL,14,Fcaptured on CCTV, and she "did not
OL,15,Fappear to be distressed".
OL,26,@vD@[OUwD@XO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/8
