OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,340,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786385905
OL,3,CUnborn child survived fall which
OL,4,Ckilled pregnant woman, inquest hears
OL,6,FDet Con Parnham said police had ruled
OL,7,Fout any third party involvement, while
OL,8,FMr Atkinson told the inquest that it
OL,9,Fwas his belief his daughter came to
OL,10,Fhis flat "with the intention of
OL,11,Fjumping out of the window to take her
OL,12,Fown life".
OL,14,FThe mother of five had suffered
OL,15,Fprevious struggles with her mental
OL,16,Fhealth and was worried about going to
OL,17,Fprison after missing a court date for
OL,18,Fa shoplifting allegation in the days
OL,19,Fbefore her death.
OL,26,@tD@IO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,340,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786385905
OL,3,CUnborn child survived fall which
OL,4,Ckilled pregnant woman, inquest hears
OL,6,FHer family, who attended the inquest,
OL,7,Fsaid she was "so excited" about the
OL,8,Fimpending births of her daughter and
OL,9,Fgrandson and "would never have left
OL,10,Fher kids", adding that her "life
OL,11,Frevolved around her children".
OL,13,FCoroner Naomi McLoughlin said there
OL,14,Fwas not enough evidence to say whether
OL,15,FMs Atkinson's death was suicide or an
OL,16,Faccident, and recorded a narrative
OL,17,Fconclusion that said: "Emma Atkinson
OL,18,Fdied from a self-inflicted act but her
OL,19,Fprobable intent cannot be ascertained
OL,20,Feither way."
OL,26,@oD@NOUoD@YO]qD@NOUrD@IO]rD@\OUsD@]O]yD@
OL,26,AWOU|D@LO]
