FL,340,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786385905
OL,3,CUnborn child survived fall which
OL,4,Ckilled pregnant woman, inquest hears
OL,6,FShe said she was satisfied that Ms
OL,7,FAtkinson had deliberately propelled
OL,8,Fherself out of the window, but added:
OL,9,F"I have to consider the issue of her
OL,10,Fintent.
OL,12,F"I note the deliberate act of removing
OL,13,Fthe safety catches from the window ...
OL,14,Fand the manner of her falling,
OL,15,Fcaptured by the CCTV."
OL,26,@qD@AOUtD@AOUwD@VO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/8
