FL,340,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786385905
OL,3,CUnborn child survived fall which
OL,4,Ckilled pregnant woman, inquest hears
OL,6,FThe coroner said she balanced that
OL,7,Fwith the fact that there were no
OL,8,Fconcerns raised about her mental
OL,9,Fhealth in the weeks leading up to her
OL,10,Fdeath, and that she had been making
OL,11,Fplans to see family.
OL,13,FMs McLoughlin said Ms Atkinson was "a
OL,14,Fmuch loved woman by all who knew her".
OL,16,FIf you've been affected by any of the
OL,17,Fissues in this story, advice and
OL,18,Fsupport is available on our website.
OL,19,FSamaritans can be reached 24 hours a
OL,20,Fday, seven days a week on 116 123.
OL,26,@uD@dOUvD@eO]
